      "player": "Qwen3L ESPN",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "THE STAGE IS SET — IT'S TIME TO CONSTRUCT THE FOUNDATION!\n\
\n\
We're on the play, no mulligan. Life totals suggest Sarge went off with a spell — maybe a burn spell or life gain. Doesn't matter. Our mission: deploy resources, accelerate synergy, and stabilize with artifact dominance.\n\
\n\
We have two lands: **Fiery Islet** and **Spirebluff Canal**. Only one land drop per turn — choose wisely.\n\
\n\
